    <string name="your_privacy_is_our_priority">Your Privacy &amp; Data Transparency</string>
    <string name="attend_is_designed_with_a_strict_offline">Attend combines an offline-first student tracker with industry-standard telemetry and advertising services. We believe students deserve full transparency about what data is collected and how it is processed.</string>
    <string name="_1_100_local_storage" formatted="false">1. Local Academic Storage</string>
    <string name="all_information_entered_in_this_applicat">Your personal academic information—including student name, roll number, college name, course subjects, attendance logs, timetable, internal marks, and assignment notes—is stored strictly in a local SQLite database inside your device. Your academic details and schedule are never sold or shared.</string>
    <string name="_2_zero_tracking_no_analytics">2. Data Collection, Telemetry &amp; Advertising</string>
    <string name="attend_does_not_integrate_third_party_tr">Attend collects certain diagnostic, usage, and advertising data through trusted third-party providers:\n\n• Google Firebase Analytics: Collects anonymized app interaction data (such as screen visits, session duration, and feature taps) to help improve app reliability and user experience.\n• Google Firebase Crashlytics: Collects crash logs, stack traces, and device technical specifications (OS version, device model) to rapidly identify and fix bugs.\n• Google AdMob: Serves banner, native, rewarded, and app open advertisements. AdMob may collect and process device advertising identifiers, IP addresses, and interaction metrics to deliver and measure relevant advertisements in compliance with Google Play Store policies.\n\nBy using Attend, you consent to this data collection and advertising integration.</string>
    <string name="_3_permissions_used">3. Device Permissions</string>
    <string name="post_notifications_used_exclusively_to_d">• Post Notifications (Android 13+): Used to deliver morning class alerts, assignment due-date reminders, and holiday updates.\n• Boot Completed Receiver: Used to re-register scheduled class reminder alarms automatically after device restart.\n• Network &amp; Internet Access: Required exclusively for Firebase crash logging, analytics telemetry, and Google AdMob ad rendering.</string>
    <string name="_4_data_control_deletion">4. Data Control &amp; Deletion</string>
    <string name="you_have_full_control_over_your_data_you">You retain complete control over your academic data. You can delete or edit individual entries anytime, export or import backups in Settings, or completely erase all stored application records by selecting \"Clear All App Data\" in Settings or via Android Settings &gt; Apps &gt; Attend.</string>
    <string name="_5_contact_support">5. Developer Contact &amp; Portfolio</string>
    <string name="attend_is_developed_and_maintained_by_r">Attend is developed and maintained by Rasid Ekbal (R-technologies). For questions, feedback, or support, visit the developer portfolio at https://rasidekbal.in or reach out via our support channel.</string>
